<div class="sub-tab-content poe2-sub-content guide-section guide-theme--poe2 legacy-database" data-legacy-redesign="legacy-database" id="poe2-guide"><div class="legacy-hero"><img alt="" class="legacy-hero-media" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="assets/guides/poe2-guide-hero.jpg"/><div class="legacy-hero-content"><span class="legacy-kicker">Path of Exile 2 · Leveling Library</span><h1 class="legacy-title">Guida PoE 2: Oggetti Unici Leveling</h1><p class="legacy-tagline">Unici da leveling organizzati in card per leggere velocemente requisiti, valore e destinazione.</p><div class="legacy-hero-meta"><span>Database interattivo</span><span>16 oggetti</span></div></div></div>

