<div class="item-details">
<a class="unique-item" href="https://www.pathofexile.com/trade2/search/poe2/Standard?q=%7B%22query%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22Bushwhack%22%7D%7D" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Bushwhack</a>
